  "releaseNotes": "Modals can hold several pages: ModalViewModel.PushAsync/PopAsync/ReplaceAsync navigate inside the modal, and any page of it can finish it with Dismiss(result). Popups and modals share PresentedViewModel; popups gain CanDismissAsync, and a background tap or Back now dismisses through the view model. Breaking: INavigationService relative navigation fails while a modal is open. See docs/migration.md.",
